     fying the test case's name.  AATTFF__TTEESSTT__CCAASSEE(), requires to define a head
     and a body for the test case, AATTFF__TTEESSTT__CCAASSEE__WWIITTHH__CCLLEEAANNUUPP() requires to
     define a head, a body and a cleanup for the test case and
     AATTFF__TTEESSTT__CCAASSEE__WWIITTHHOOUUTT__HHEEAADD() requires only a body for the test case.  It
     is important to note that these _d_o _n_o_t set the test case up for execution
     when the program is run.  In order to do so, a later registration is
     needed through the AATTFF__AADDDD__TTEESSTT__CCAASSEE() macro detailed in _P_r_o_g_r_a_m
     _i_n_i_t_i_a_l_i_z_a_t_i_o_n.

